  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et habeat postea dampnum illud ex incuria sua, ut cambiat ab institutis monetariis purum et recte appendens.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And afterwards such a trader shall pay the penalty of his carelessness by having to change [his base money] for pure money of the proper weight obtained from the authorised moneyers.</ab>
      </div>
